Use Oidc\cOidcClaimResolver.pkg

Class cMyDemoResolver is a cOidcClaimResolver
    Procedure OnResolveClaim tOidcUserInfo tUserInfo tOidcClient tClient String sClaim Boolean bIsSystemScope String  ByRef sValue
        // Dont forward send, we should implement this here
        
        Case Begin
            Case (sClaim = "download_center_role")
                Move "example" to sValue
                Case Break
            
            Case Else
                // By default do nothing
        Case End
    End_Procedure
    
End_Class